IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `thpa-haze`

-- Transboundary Haze Pollution Act 2014, ss 2, 3, 5 to 10, 14 to 16, 19 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_transboundary-haze-pollution-act-2014.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

